---
import Book from '../layouts/Book.astro';import{sources,lessons}from'../lib/content';
---
<Book title="Source library"><span class="eyebrow">PROVENANCE, WITH VERIFICATION DEPTH</span><h1>Source library</h1><p class="dek">Primary research, official teaching material, and author-maintained references. Verification of an abstract is distinguished from reading the full text.</p><p>The curriculum audit was checked on <strong>2 November 2026</strong>. Sources have their own publication and revision dates. A catalog supplies discovery leads; the lesson's inline citation and worked argument support a technical claim.</p>{sources.map(s=><article class="source-entry" id={s.id}><h2><a href={s.url}>{s.title}</a></h2><p>{s.authors}</p><p><strong>Supports:</strong> {s.supports}</p><p class="small muted">Verification: {s.verification} · {s.verified??'Not verified'}{s.note&&` · ${s.note}`}</p><p class="small">Used by: {lessons.filter(l=>l.sourceIds.includes(s.id)).map((l,i)=><Fragment>{i>0?' · ':''}<a href={`/lessons/${l.id}/`}>{String(l.sequence).padStart(2,'0')} {l.title}</a></Fragment>)}</p></article>)}</Book>
